<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.1_7.3.2.1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentJustification> "ISO 5259-3 §7.3.2.1 requires a data specification validated as consistent and complete for intended use, functionally aligning with Art 10(1). Gap: ISO 5259 is sector-neutral and does not specifically address high-risk AI systems under regulatory oversight."@en .
