<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.4_7.3.1.1_Rb> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentGap> "Explicit characterisation of geographical, contextual, behavioural and functional deployment setting is not required by ISO 5259-3."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.4_7.3.1.1_Rb> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentJustification> "ISO 5259-3 §7.3.1.1(b) requires specifying scope and intended use, implicitly encompassing deployment setting. Gap: ISO does not explicitly require characterising geographical, behavioural or functional deployment context as distinct quality parameters."@en .
