<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.a_NoAlignment> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generatedAtTime> "2026-04-14T00:00:00+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.a_NoAlignment> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#KuruvillaGeorgeAiyankovil> .
