<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.a_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentBasis> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#GapIdentified> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.a_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentGap> "GDPR proportionality principle — necessity test for personal data over synthetic alternatives — is outside ISO 5259 scope. Recommended: GDPR Art.9; AI Act Art.10(5)(a)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.a_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentJustification> "ISO 5259 does not require demonstrating necessity of processing personal data over synthetic alternatives. This is a legal necessity test specific to data protection law."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.a_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentType> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#NoAlignment> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.a_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#coveredCQs> "CQ-M3, CQ-M5" .
