<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#AlignmentAssertion> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generatedAtTime> "2026-04-14T00:00:00+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#KuruvillaGeorgeAiyankovil> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasGeneratedBy> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#MappingProcess_v2> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentBasis> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#GapIdentified> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentGap> "Pseudonymisation, state-of-art security, strict GDPR access controls outside ISO 5259 scope. Recommended: ISO/IEC 27001; ISO/IEC 27701; ENISA AI Cybersecurity Guidelines."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentJustification> "ISO 5259 does not impose pseudonymisation or state-of-art security measures as normative requirements. ISO 5259-4 mentions data privacy conceptually but not at the normative level Art 10(5)(b) requires."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentType> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#NoAlignment> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#coveredCQs> "CQ-M3, CQ-M5" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#legalRequirement> <https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5_b> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#technicalRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.b_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#validationStatus> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ExpertValidated> .
