<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.e_7.3.8.3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentGap> "The legal deletion trigger — bias corrected OR retention period ended — is not addressed by ISO 5259-3."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.e_7.3.8.3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentJustification> "ISO 5259-3 §7.3.8.3 requires deletion from all storage locations. Gap: ISO does not tie deletion to the legal trigger (bias corrected OR retention period ended)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5.e_7.3.8.3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentType> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#PartiallySatisfies> .
