<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentGap> "Requires GDPR Art.9 + ISO/IEC 27701 compliance. ISO 5259 cannot satisfy this obligation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo#Map_10.5_NoAlignment> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignmentJustification> "ISO 5259 has no provision for special categories of personal data processing. This is a legal obligation under GDPR Article 9 — structurally outside ISO 5259 scope."@en .
