<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall manage data processing tools to ensure they support data quality requirements, covering: a) approved tool list with version information; b) tool qualification and validation; c) access control and licensing; d) backup and recovery; e) monitoring of tool-induced data quality issues; f) tool change management; g) documentation of tool-specific data quality constraints."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data processing tools — management"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "10.2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ToolManagementStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataProcessingToolsReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#changeManagement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQuality> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_10_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#qualityRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_11_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_11_2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_11_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_11_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_11_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_11_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall manage data quality dependencies by: a) identifying all data quality dependencies between datasets and processes; b) documenting the impact of dependency failures on data quality; c) specifying mitigation strategies for dependency-related quality risks."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_11_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data quality dependencies — management"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_11_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "11.2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_11_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#DependencyManagementStage> .
