<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityModel> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#riskManagement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_6_3_3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall meet data quality requirements by: a) having processes for communicating, analysing, evaluating, resolving and closing (implementing a resolution or giving a reason for not being an unreasonable risk) issues of data quality; b) documenting closed issues; c) escalating issues that cannot be closed."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Management of data quality issues"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "6.3.3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#OrganisationalStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataQualityIssuesMgmtReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQuality> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#qualityRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_6_3_4" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall: a) document required skills and tools to process the data; b) ensure that involved persons have sufficient skills to perform their activities and duties; c) maintain proof of sufficient skill with the data quality system; d) keep appropriate records of training and experience that substantiate claims of competency."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Competence management"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "6.3.4" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#OrganisationalStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoCompetenceMgmtReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_4> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQuality> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_6_3_5" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall provide the resources required for data quality management, including: a) appropriate software licenses and technical support for required tools; b) required IT infrastructure or services to meet the storage and compute requirements; c) availability of skilled persons."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Resource management"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "6.3.5" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#OrganisationalStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoResourceMgmtReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityManagement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Documentation shall be intelligible to relevant stakeholders in accordance with their role."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Documentation — intelligibility"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "6.3.7" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#OrganisationalStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDocumentationReqColl> .
