<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Documentation shall be accessible to relevant stakeholders as appropriate and authorized."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Documentation — accessibility"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "6.3.7" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#OrganisationalStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDocumentationReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_7_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#stakeholder> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_6_3_8" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The implemented processes shall be audited when appropriate. The audit shall: a) evaluate the data quality plan against the organizational rules and processes for data quality; b) determine whether planned activities have been implemented and maintained effectively; c) identify non-compliances and propose corrective actions; d) document audit findings and conclusions; e) communicate findings to relevant stakeholders."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data quality audit and assessment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "6.3.8" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#OrganisationalStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataQualityAuditReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQuality> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_8> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityPlan> .
