<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_6_3_9" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Data quality shall be confirmed by appropriate data quality measures in accordance with ISO/IEC 5259-2. All work products shall undergo confirmation reviews that: a) confirm that work products meet the data specification; b) confirm that data quality measures have been applied correctly; c) identify any remaining open issues; d) authorise progression to the next life cycle stage."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Confirmation review and DQ measures"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "6.3.9" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#OrganisationalStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoConfirmationReviewReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQuality> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityMeasure> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataSpecificationDoc> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Confirmation reviews shall be performed by personnel independent of the activities under review."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Confirmation review — independent personnel"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "6.3.9" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#OrganisationalStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_6_3_9_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoConfirmationReviewReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall specify the processes to be performed in each stage of the DQMLC in accordance with the requirements of this document."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "DQMLC — specify processes"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.2.1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#LifeCycleGeneralStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDQLCReqColl> .
