<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall ensure that each stage of the DQMLC is only entered when all quality gates for the preceding stage have been met."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "DQMLC — quality gates"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.2.1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#LifeCycleGeneralStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDQLCReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityManagementLifeCycle> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall document all deviations from the defined DQMLC together with a justification and any compensating measures."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "DQMLC — document deviations"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.2.1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#LifeCycleGeneralStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDQLCReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_2_1_R3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityManagementLifeCycle> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_1_1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall: a) document motivation and origin of the data need; b) specify scope, purpose and intended use of data; c) document the data quality requirements."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data motivation and conceptualization"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.1.1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#MotivationStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataMotivationReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#qualityRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_1_2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall: a) identify all stakeholders relevant to the data and the intended use; b) document stakeholder data quality requirements and expectations."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Stakeholder analysis"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.1.2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#MotivationStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoStakeholderAnalysisReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#qualityRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_1_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#stakeholder> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_2_1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall specify data requirements in a data specification and validate that these requirements are consistent and complete for the intended use."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data specification General"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.2.1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#SpecificationStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataSpecificationReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataSpecificationDoc> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_2_2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The data specification shall include: a) the data type(s) of each data item; b) the allowed range or set of values for each data item; c) the encoding and representation standards; d) the unit of measurement for quantitative data items; e) the definition of missing or null values; f) any required data structure (e.g. tabular, hierarchical, graph); g) inter-data constraints and integrity rules; h) metadata requirements; i) versioning and provenance requirements; j) any other format constraints relevant to intended use."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data format specification"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.2.2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#SpecificationStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataFormatReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataItem> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataProvenance> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataSpecificationDoc> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataType> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#measurement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#metadata> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The data specification shall include specification of valid divisions into subsets (e.g. training, validation and test data) and the criteria for assigning data items to subsets."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Statistical properties — subset divisions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.2.3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#SpecificationStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoStatisticalPropertiesReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataItem> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataSpecificationDoc> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#testData> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall determine and maintain for each subset: relevant statistical properties, representativeness with respect to the target population, and appropriate size to meet the intended purpose."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Statistical properties — representativeness"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.2.3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#SpecificationStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoStatisticalPropertiesReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_2_3_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#representativeness> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_3_1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall establish a data quality plan that covers: a) the processes, activities and resources required to meet the data specification throughout the data life cycle; b) entry and exit criteria for each DQMLC stage; c) the data quality measures to be applied; d) responsibilities and authorities for DQM activities; e) schedule and milestones for DQM activities."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data planning General"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.3.1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#PlanningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataPlanningReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataLifeCycle> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityManagementLifeCycle> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityMeasure> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityPlan> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataSpecificationDoc> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_3_2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall establish life cycle stage-specific plans addressing: a) data acquisition plan; b) data preprocessing plan; c) data augmentation plan; d) data provisioning plan; e) data decommissioning plan."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data life cycle specific plans"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.3.2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#PlanningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataLifeCyclePlansReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataAcquisition> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_3_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataAugmentation> .
