<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_4_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Documented conditions of the reuse or license of a dataset shall be taken into account. The organization can delegate data acquisition to a third party but remains responsible for meeting data quality requirements."@en .
