<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_4_3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall document: a) reasons for collection, including the relationship to the data specification; b) the method of data collection; c) the data collection specification including data item descriptions; d) required resources and skills for data collection; e) anonymisation or pseudonymisation methods where applicable; f) measurement scales and units; g) expected deviations from the data specification and their justification."@en .
