<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_5_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall specify data quality measures to be applied for cleaning, including measures for: a) missing data items; b) duplication; c) outliers; d) bias and drift; e) non-standard or invalid data values; f) unneeded or irrelevant data items; g) required transformations; h) verification that cleaning results meet the data specification; i) de-identification or anonymisation where applicable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_5_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data cleaning"@en .
