<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_6_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataSpecificationDoc> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_7_1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall: a) specify data provisioning processes to meet the data specification; b) provide auditable evidence that provisioned data meets all specified data quality requirements; c) ensure that the provisioning process does not alter the data beyond what is specified; d) document all provisioning activities; e) maintain a record of all data provisioned, including version and provenance information; f) ensure that recipients are authorised to receive the provisioned data; g) ensure that provisioning complies with applicable legal and contractual obligations."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data provisioning General"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.7.1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ProvisioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataProvisioningReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataProvenance> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataProvisioning> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataSpecificationDoc> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#qualityRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_7_3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Documentation provisioned with data shall include: a) scope of use and intended purpose; b) instructions for use; c) statistical properties of the dataset; d) description of each data item; e) list of stakeholders and their roles; f) duties and obligations of the recipient; g) use environment requirements; h) quality factors and their measurement results; i) acceptance test methods; j) communication strategy for updates and issue reporting."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data provisioning documentation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.7.3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ProvisioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataProvisioningDocReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataItem> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataProvisioning> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataset> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#measurement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#stakeholder> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall monitor the use of provisioned data to detect any degradation of data quality or deviations from the intended use."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tracking — data usage monitoring"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.7.4" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ProvisioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoTrackingImprovementReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQuality> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall define and apply corrective actions when deviations or degradation are detected."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tracking — corrective actions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.7.4" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ProvisioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoTrackingImprovementReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall use tracking results as feedback to improve data quality planning and acquisition processes."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tracking — improvement feedback"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.7.4" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ProvisioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoTrackingImprovementReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_4_R3> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQuality> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_7_5" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall specify data optimization processes that: a) reduce storage and computational overhead without reducing quality below specified thresholds; b) apply only transformations that are documented and reversible or justified; c) validate that optimised data still meets the data specification; d) maintain a record of all optimisation operations applied."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data optimization"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.7.5" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ProvisioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataOptimizationReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataSpecificationDoc> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall specify the support it will provide for provisioned data, including the duration of support and conditions for termination."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Support commitment — specify"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.7.6" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ProvisioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoSupportCommitmentReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall document all support commitments in a support agreement that covers: a) scope of support; b) response times and service levels; c) versioning and update policy; d) conditions for withdrawal of data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Support commitment — documentation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.7.6" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#ProvisioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_7_6_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoSupportCommitmentReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_8_1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall choose an appropriate method to decommission the data either through data deletion or through data transfer to a qualified recipient."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data decommissioning — choose method"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.8.1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#DecommissioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataDecommissioningReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataDecommissioning> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The organization shall specify data decommissioning processes in the data quality plan, including the schedule and criteria for decommissioning."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data decommissioning — specify processes"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.8.1" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#DecommissioningStage> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#inCollection> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoDataDecommissioningReqColl> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataDecommissioning> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_1_R2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#uses> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#dataQualityPlan> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AidgoReq_7_3_8_2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 5259-3" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#TechnicalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "When transferring data, the organization shall ensure that the recipient meets the data quality requirements and has the authority to receive the data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data transfer — conditions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#clauseNumber> "7.3.8.2" .
<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_7_3_8_2> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#dqmlcStage> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#DecommissioningStage> .
