<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_8_3_3_4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Change requests shall be analysed to determine: a) impact on data quality; b) impact on dependent datasets, processes and plans; c) risks introduced by the change; d) alternative solutions; e) resources required; f) impact on schedule."@en .
