<https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoReq_8_3_3_5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Change requests shall be evaluated and: a) approved, with conditions if necessary; b) deferred to a later stage; c) rejected with justification."@en .
