<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.2_5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "[Data governance and management practices shall concern in particular] the formulation of assumptions, in particular with respect to the information that the data is supposed to measure and represent."@en .
