<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.3_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Datasets shall have the appropriate statistical properties, including as regards the persons or groups of persons on which the high-risk AI system is intended to be used."@en .
