<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Datasets shall take into account the characteristics particular to the geographical, contextual, behavioural or functional setting of intended use."@en .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Datasets shall account for characteristics of the deployment setting"@en .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.4> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#alignedWith> <https://w3id.org/aidgo/iso5259#AidgoConjReq_7.3.1.1_Rb> .
