<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Providers may process special categories of personal data strictly necessary for bias detection, subject to appropriate safeguards."@en .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Special categories personal data may be processed for bias detection"@en .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#articleReference> "Art. 10(5)" .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#coverageStatus> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#NotCovered> .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5_a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "AiaPrReq_10.5_a" .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5_a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/aidgo#LegalRequirement> .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tair#Requirement> .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5_a> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ensuring bias detection cannot effectively be fulfilled by processing other categories of data, including synthetic or anonymised data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/euaiact/art10#AiaPrReq_10.5_a> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Bias cannot be fulfilled by synthetic/anonymised data alternatives"@en .
